  "origin": {
    "kind": "new",
    "note": "Written for live-mix on cpp/kit. The two-deck tape delay of Frippertronics and Discreet Music in outline (one record head, one playback head a loop length away, the playback fed back to the record deck), with a varispeed playback head; not a model of any machine."
  }
